local list = {
    {"^You may have noticed my mechanical companion here%, G([%d%.,]+)%-B([%d%.,]+)G%. Whirlin%' around in that burlap chest of his is the one%, and only%, working prototype of my gas%-powered engine%.\r\n\r\nI figure it%'s in need of some stress testing%. How%'d you like to take him on in a fight%? I can power him up with the gas you%'ve collected%.\r\n\r\nOh%, and don%'t worry about hurting him%. He can%'t feel a thing%!$", "Du har måske bemærket min mekaniske ledsager her, G{1}-B{2}G. Hvirvlende rundt i den sæklærreds-kiste af hans ligger den ene, eneste fungerende prototype på min gasdrevne motor.\r\n\r\nJeg regner med, at den trænger til en omgang stresstest. Hvad siger du til at tage ham op i en kamp? Jeg kan give ham kraft med den gas, du har samlet.\r\n\r\nÅh, og bekymr dig ikke om at såre ham. Han kan ikke mærke en skid!", "G. Whirlin' around in that burlap chest of his is the one, and only, working prototype of my gas-powered engine.\r\n\r\nI figure it's in need of some stress testing. How'd you like to take him on in a fight? I can power him up with the gas you've collected.\r\n\r\nOh, and don't worry about hurting him. He can't feel a thing!"},
    {"^Engrave your belt with the Nourish rune%:\r\n\r\n%|T236162%:24%|t\r\nHeals a friendly target for ([%d%.,]+) to ([%d%.,]+)%. Heals for an additional ([%d%.,]+)%% if you have a Rejuvenation%, Regrowth%, Lifebloom%, or Wild Growth effect active on the target%. This spell benefits from and triggers all effects associated with Healing Touch or Regrowth%.$", "Gravér dit bælte med Nærende-runen:\r\n\r\n|T236162:24|t\r\nHeler et venligt mål for {1} til {2}. Heler for yderligere {3}%, hvis du har en Foryngelse-, Genvækst-, Livsblomst- eller Vild Vækst-effekt aktiv på målet. Denne besværgelse drager fordel af og udløser alle effekter knyttet til Helbredende Berøring eller Genvækst.", "% if you have a Rejuvenation, Regrowth, Lifebloom, or Wild Growth effect active on the target. This spell benefits from and triggers all effects associated with Healing Touch or Regrowth."},
    {"^Engrave your chest or robe with the Wild Strikes rune%:\r\n\r\n%|T132143%:24%|t\r\nWhile you are in Cat Form%, Bear Form%, or Dire Bear Form%, party or raid members within ([%d%.,]+) yards gain increased combat ferocity%.  Each melee hit has a ([%d%.,]+)%% chance of granting the attacker an extra attack with ([%d%.,]+)%% additional Attack Power%. No effect if the target is already benefitting from Windfury Totem%.\r\n$", "Gravér dit bryst eller din kåbe med Vilde Stødder-runen:\r\n\r\n|T132143:24|t\r\nMens du er i Katteform, Bjørneform eller Frygtindgydende Bjørneform, får gruppe- eller togt-medlemmer inden for {1} meter øget kampvildskab.  Hvert nærkamp-angreb har en {2}% sjans for at give angriberen et ekstra angreb med {3}% ekstra Angrebskraft. Ingen effekt, hvis målet allerede drager fordel af Vindraseri-totem.\r\n", "Engrave your chest or robe with the Wild Strikes rune:\r\n\r\n|T132143:24|t\r\nWhile you are in Cat Form, Bear Form, or Dire Bear Form, party or raid members within "},
    {"^Dang%, the two of you really went at it%! Couldn%'t have asked for a better show%, and I got some great notes to boot%.\r\n\r\nI%'ll fix up ol%' G([%d%.,]+) here and make some changes to the engine%. He%'ll be ready to go again in no time%.\r\n\r\nTest%, tweak%, test%, tweak%. Such is the life of a great inventor%.$", "Pokkers, I to gik jo virkelig løs på hinanden! Et bedre show kunne jeg ikke have ønsket mig, og jeg fik nogle gode noter med hjem på købet.\r\n\r\nJeg fikser lige den gamle G{1} her og laver nogle ændringer i motoren. Han er klar til at gå igen om ingen tid.\r\n\r\nTest, justér, test, justér. Sådan er livet for en stor opfinder.", " here and make some changes to the engine. He'll be ready to go again in no time.\r\n\r\nTest, tweak, test, tweak. Such is the life of a great inventor."},
    {"^Get Patrick Garrett%'s family treasure from their family chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman%, and bring it to him in the Undercity%.\n\n([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Garrett Family Treasure$", "Hent Patrik Garrats familieskat fra deres familiekiste i Syd-Almindelig-Hallen i Uldhulen, og bring den til ham i Undergrunden.\n\n{1}/{2} Garrat-familiens skat", "Get Patrick Garrett's family treasure from their family chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman, and bring it to him in the Undercity.\n\n"},
    {"^Provides immunity to Charm%, Fear and Sleep while active%.  May also be used while already afflicted by Charm%, Fear or Sleep%.  Lasts ([%d%.,]+) sec%.$", "Giver immunitet over for Charme, Frygt og Søvn, mens den er aktiv.  Kan også bruges, mens man allerede er ramt af Charme, Frygt eller Søvn.  Varer {1} sek.", "Provides immunity to Charm, Fear and Sleep while active.  May also be used while already afflicted by Charm, Fear or Sleep.  Lasts "},
    {"^Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg%'s Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar%.\r\n\n\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Rig Blueprints%|r\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Thermaplugg%'s Safe Combination%|r$", "Hent Rig-tegninger og Thermapluggs safekombination fra Gnomregan og bring dem til Nogg i Orgrimgrad.\r\n\n\n|cff6e5c40{1}/{2} Rig-tegninger|r\n|cff6e5c40{3}/{4} Thermapluggs safekombination|r", "Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.\r\n\n\n|cff6e5c40"},
    {"^Increases the damage done or health drained by your Drain Life%, Drain Soul%, and Wrack spells by ([%d%.,]+)%% per each of your Corruption%, Siphon Life%, and Bane of Agony effects active on the target%, up to a maximum increase of ([%d%.,]+)%%%.$", "Øger skaden forvoldt eller helbredet drænet af dine Dræn Liv-, Dræn Sjæl- og Pine-besværgelser med {1}% pr. aktiv Fordærvelse-, Livssug- og Bane af Kval-effekt på målet, op til en maksimal forøgelse på {2}%.", "% per each of your Corruption, Siphon Life, and Bane of Agony effects active on the target, up to a maximum increase of "},
    {"^Recover ([%d%.,]+) Stolen Shipments from the Ruins of Zul%'Kunda in Stranglethorn Vale and return your haul to someone in Booty Bay%.$", "Genvind {1} Stjålne Forsendelser fra Ruinerne af Zul'Kaffe i Kvælertorn-dalen og returner dit bytte til nogen i Byttebugten.", " Stolen Shipments from the Ruins of Zul'Kunda in Stranglethorn Vale and return your haul to someone in Booty Bay."},
    {"^Increases Health drained%, damage done%, or Mana drained by your Drain Life%, Drain Soul%, and Drain Mana spells by ([%d%.,]+)%%%.$", "Øger det drænede Liv, forvoldt skade eller drænet Mana fra dine besværgelser Dræn Liv, Dræn Sjæl og Dræn Mana med {1}%.", "Increases Health drained, damage done, or Mana drained by your Drain Life, Drain Soul, and Drain Mana spells by "},
    {"^Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity%.\n\n([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Highly Toxic Strain$", "Saml den Yderst Giftige Stamme fra Visnetand i Ruinerne af Herrelande for Theodore Klo i Undergrunden.\n\n{1}/{2} Yderst Giftig Stamme", "Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity.\n\n"},
    {"^Bring the Gems of Cobrahn%, Anacondra%, Pythas and Serpentis to Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff%.\n\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Gem of Cobrahn%|r\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Gem of Anacondra%|r\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Gem of Pythas%|r\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Gem of Serpentis%|r$", "Bring Juvelerne fra Kobrahn, Anakondra, Pythas og Serpentis til Nara Vildmanke i Tordenklippe.\n\n|cff6e5c40{1}/{2} Ædelsten fra Kobrahn|r\n|cff6e5c40{3}/{4} Ædelsten fra Anakondra|r\n|cff6e5c40{5}/{6} Ædelsten fra Pythas|r\n|cff6e5c40{7}/{8} Ædelsten fra Serpentis|r", "Bring the Gems of Cobrahn, Anacondra, Pythas and Serpentis to Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff.\n\n|cff6e5c40"},
    {"^Collect the Arcane Mote in the City of Dalaran for Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill%.\n\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Arcane Mote%|r$", "Saml Arkan-partikel i Dalarns By til Magus Ordeen Tomglimt i Tarrenmølle.\n\n|cff6e5c40{1}/{2} Arkan-partikel|r", "Collect the Arcane Mote in the City of Dalaran for Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill.\n\n|cff6e5c40"},
    {"^Improves resistance to fire%-based attacks%, spells%, and abilities\n\nAverage resistance versus a level ([%d%.,]+) enemy%: %|cffffffff([%d%.,]+)%%%|r$", "Forbedrer modstand mod ildbaserede angreb, besværgelser og evner\n\nGennemsnitlig modstand over for en fjende på niveau {1}: |cffffffff{2}%|r", "Improves resistance to fire-based attacks, spells, and abilities\n\nAverage resistance versus a level "},
    {"^Retrieve ([%d%.,]+) Woodworker%'s Axe from the lumberjacks at Turner%'s Logging Camp for Kreza Darkthorn in Rog%'mar%.$", "Hent {1} Træarbejderens Økse fra skovhuggerne i Turners Tømmerlejr for Kreza Mørketorn i Rygmar.", " Woodworker's Axe from the lumberjacks at Turner's Logging Camp for Kreza Darkthorn in Rog'mar."},
    {"^Use the Crate with Holes to summon a Snufflenose Gopher and the Command Stick to make it find ([%d%.,]+) Blueleaf Tubers%. Bring them%, the Command Stick and the Crate back to Mebok Mizzyrix%.$", "Brug Kassen med Huller til at tilkalde en Snufsenæse-jordrotte og Kommandostokken for at få den til at finde {1} Blåblads-knolde. Bring dem, Kommandostokken og Kassen tilbage til Mebok Snurrefix.", "Use the Crate with Holes to summon a Snufflenose Gopher and the Command Stick to make it find "},
    {"^Collect ([%d%.,]+) Grizzled Bear Hearts and ([%d%.,]+) samples of Skittering Blood and deliver them to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity%.$", "Saml {1} Gråbrunte bjørnehjerter og {2} prøver af Rislende Blod og lever dem til Mesterapoteker Faranell i Undergrunden.", " samples of Skittering Blood and deliver them to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."},
    {"^Infiltrate Krol%'dok Stronghold and return to Krom%'rosh with proof of their leader%'s demise%.\n\n([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Eye of Mugg$", "Infiltrer Krol'dok Stærkefæste og vend tilbage til Krom'rose med bevis for deres lederes død.\n\n{1}/{2} Krus' Øje", "Infiltrate Krol'dok Stronghold and return to Krom'rosh with proof of their leader's demise.\n\n"},
    {"^Craftsman Wilhelm at Light%'s Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him ([%d%.,]+) Frozen Runes%, ([%d%.,]+) Essence of Water%, ([%d%.,]+) Blue Sapphires and ([%d%.,]+) gold pieces%.$", "Håndværker Vilhelm ved Lysets Håb-kapellet i de Østlige Pestlande vil have dig til at bringe ham {1} Frosne Runer, {2} Vandets Essens, {3} Blå Safirer og {4} guldstykker.", "Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him "},
    {"^Collect Wood Bundles from Peasant Woodpiles in Turner%'s Logging Camp then fletch them into ([%d%.,]+) Makeshift Stickin%' Spears%.$", "Saml Træbundter fra Bondens brændestabler i Turners Tømmerlejr og flet dem til {1} Nødtørftige Klistrede Spyd.", "Collect Wood Bundles from Peasant Woodpiles in Turner's Logging Camp then fletch them into "},
    {"^Smokey LaRue wants you to get ([%d%.,]+) Thorium Bars%, ([%d%.,]+) Golden Rod%, ([%d%.,]+) Hi%-Explosive Bombs%, and ([%d%.,]+) Unstable Triggers%.\n\nYou will have to find a blacksmith and an engineer for these items%.$", "Smøg LaRue vil have dig til at skaffe {1} Thoriumstænger, {2} Gylden Stang, {3} Højeksplosive Bomber og {4} Ustabile Udløsere.\n\nDu bliver nødt til at finde en smed og en ingeniør til disse ting.", " Unstable Triggers.\n\nYou will have to find a blacksmith and an engineer for these items."},
    {"^When activated%, regenerates ([%d%.,]+)%% of total health every ([%d%.,]+) sec for ([%d%.,]+) sec%.  Only works on Humanoid or Undead corpses within ([%d%.,]+) yds%.  Any movement%, action%, or damage taken while Cannibalizing will cancel the effect%.$", "Når den aktiveres, regenererer {1}% af samlet helbred hvert {2} sek. i {3} sek.  Virker kun på Humanoid- eller Udøde-lig inden for {4} yd.  Enhver bevægelse, handling eller modtagen skade under kannibalisering annullerer effekten.", " yds.  Any movement, action, or damage taken while Cannibalizing will cancel the effect."},
    {"^Retrieve ([%d%.,]+) Twilight Missives from Twilight Shadowmancers in Sunnyglade for Tran%'gul in Rog%'mar%.$", "Hent {1} Tusmørke-budskaber fra Tusmørke-skyggemanterne i Solskinslysningen for Tran'gul i Rygmar.", " Twilight Missives from Twilight Shadowmancers in Sunnyglade for Tran'gul in Rog'mar."},
    {"^Bring the Fathom Core to Je%'neu Sancrea at Zoram%'gar Outpost%, Ashenvale%.\n\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Fathom Core%|r$", "Bring Dybkernen til Je'neu Sancrea ved Zoram'gar-forposten, Askedalen.\n\n|cff6e5c40{1}/{2} Dybkernen|r", "Bring the Fathom Core to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.\n\n|cff6e5c40"},
    {"^Udstyr%: Increases damage done to Humanoids by magical spells and effects by up to ([%d%.,]+)%.$", "Udstyr: Øger skade forvoldt på Humanoider af magiske besværgelser og effekter med op til {1}.", "Udstyr: Increases damage done to Humanoids by magical spells and effects by up to "},
    {"^Gained the following camp benefits%:\r\n\r\nFirst Aid Kit%: Stamina increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\nCamp Chair%: Critical strike chance with all spells and attacks increased by ([%d%.,]+)%%%.\r\n\r\n$", "Opnåede følgende lejrfordele:\r\n\r\nFørstehjælpskasse: Udholdenhed øget med {1}.\r\n\r\nLejrstol: Kritisk slag-chance med alle besværgelser og angreb øget med {2}%.\r\n\r\n", ".\r\n\r\nCamp Chair: Critical strike chance with all spells and attacks increased by "},
    {"^Bring ([%d%.,]+) Ghost%-o%-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace%.$", "Bring {1} Spøgelses-o-plasmaer og kassen med Spøgelsesmagneter til Hornsnurr Brumbuzzle i Ørkenløs.", " Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace."},
    {"^Bring ([%d%.,]+) pile of Kraul Guano to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity%.\n\n%|cff6e5c40([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Kraul Guano%|r$", "Bring {1} dynge Kraul-guano til Mesterapoteker Faranell i Undergrunden.\n\n|cff6e5c40{2}/{3} Kraul-guano|r", " pile of Kraul Guano to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.\n\n|cff6e5c40"},
    {"^Brug%: Permanently increase the Spell Power value by ([%d%.,]+) and armor value by ([%d%.,]+) of an item worn on the chest%, legs%, hands%, or feet%. Only usable on items level ([%d%.,]+) and above%.$", "Brug: Permanent øger Besværgelseskraft-værdien med {1} og rustningsværdien med {2} for en genstand, der bæres på bryst, ben, hænder eller fødder. Kun brugbar på genstande af niveau {3} og højere.", " of an item worn on the chest, legs, hands, or feet. Only usable on items level "},
    {"^Gained the following camp benefits%:\r\n\r\nSharpening Wheel%: Strength increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\nEnchanted Lute%: Armor increased by ([%d%.,]+)%, all attributes increased by ([%d%.,]+)%, and all resistances increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\n$", "Opnåede følgende lejrfordele:\r\n\r\nSlibehjul: Styrke øget med {1}.\r\n\r\nFortryllet Lut: Rustning øget med {2}, alle egenskaber øget med {3} og alle modstande øget med {4}.\r\n\r\n", "Gained the following camp benefits:\r\n\r\nSharpening Wheel: Strength increased by "},
    {"^Brug%: Permanently increase the Stamina value by ([%d%.,]+) and armor value by ([%d%.,]+) of an item worn on the chest%, legs%, hands or feet%. Only usable on items level ([%d%.,]+) and above%. %(([%d%.,]+) Sec Cooldown%)$", "Brug: Permanent øger Udholdenhed-værdien med {1} og rustningsværdien med {2} for en genstand, der bæres på bryst, ben, hænder eller fødder. Kun brugbar på genstande af niveau {3} og højere. ({4} Sek Nedkøling)", " of an item worn on the chest, legs, hands or feet. Only usable on items level "},
    {"^Slay ([%d%.,]+) Meadowsbrook Farmhands%, then return to Krom%'rosh with news of your success%.$", "Slå {1} Engbæk-landarbejdere ihjel, og vend derefter tilbage til Krom'rose med nyheden om din succes.", " Meadowsbrook Farmhands, then return to Krom'rosh with news of your success."},
    {"^Gained the following camp benefits%:\r\n\r\nFirst Aid Kit%: Stamina increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\nFish Bowl%: All stats increased by ([%d%.,]+)%%%.\r\n\r\n$", "Opnåede følgende lejrfordele:\r\n\r\nFørstehjælpskasse: Udholdenhed øget med {1}.\r\n\r\nFiskeskål: Alle egenskaber øget med {2}%.\r\n\r\n", "Gained the following camp benefits:\r\n\r\nFirst Aid Kit: Stamina increased by "},
    {"^Bring ([%d%.,]+) Jungle Stalker Feathers to Far Seer Mok%'thardin at the Grom%'gol base camp%.$", "Bring {1} Vildnis-snigerfjer til Den Fjerne Seer Mok'hårdin ved Grommegol-basislejren.", " Jungle Stalker Feathers to Far Seer Mok'thardin at the Grom'gol base camp."},
    {"^Gained the following camp benefits%:\r\n\r\nEnchanted Lute%: Armor increased by ([%d%.,]+)%, all attributes increased by ([%d%.,]+)%, and all resistances increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\nIncense Candle%: Intellect increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\n$", "Opnåede følgende lejrfordele:\r\n\r\nFortryllet Lut: Rustning øget med {1}, alle egenskaber øget med {2}, og alle modstandsevner øget med {3}.\r\n\r\nRøgelseslys: Intellekt øget med {4}.\r\n\r\n", "Gained the following camp benefits:\r\n\r\nEnchanted Lute: Armor increased by "},
    {"^Bring the Fathom Core to Je%'neu Sancrea at Zoram%'gar Outpost%, Ashenvale%.\n\n([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Fathom Core$", "Bring Dybkernen til Je'neu Sancrea ved Zoram'gar-forposten, Askedalen.\n\n{1}/{2} Dybkernen", "Bring the Fathom Core to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.\n\n"},
    {"^Destroy ([%d%.,]+) Twilight Ritual Circles found throughout the caves underneath Sunnyglade%.$", "Ødelæg {1} Tusmørke-ritualkredse fundet overalt i hulerne under Solskinslysningen.", " Twilight Ritual Circles found throughout the caves underneath Sunnyglade."},
    {"^Gained the following camp benefits%:\r\n\r\nEnchanted Lute%: Armor increased by ([%d%.,]+)%, all attributes increased by ([%d%.,]+)%, and all resistances increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\nFish Bowl%: All stats increased by ([%d%.,]+)%%%.\r\n\r\n$", "Opnået følgende lejrfordele:\r\n\r\nFortryllet Lut: Rustning øget med {1}, alle egenskaber øget med {2} og alle modstande øget med {3}.\r\n\r\nFiskeskål: Alle egenskaber øget med {4}%.\r\n\r\n", "Gained the following camp benefits:\r\n\r\nEnchanted Lute: Armor increased by "},
    {"^Gained the following camp benefits%:\r\n\r\nFish Bowl%: All stats increased by ([%d%.,]+)%%%.\r\n\r\nLodestone%: Melee Attack Power increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.\r\n\r\nFaction Banner%: Spirit increased by ([%d%.,]+)%.$", "Opnået følgende lejrfordele:\r\n\r\nFiskeskål: Alle egenskaber øget med {1}%.\r\n\r\nMagnetsten: Nærkamps Angrebskraft øget med {2}.\r\n\r\nFraktionsbanner: Ånd øget med {3}.", "Gained the following camp benefits:\r\n\r\nFish Bowl: All stats increased by "},
    {"^Bring ([%d%.,]+) Hearts of Zeal from the Scarlet Monastery to Master Apothecary Faranell%.$", "Bring {1} Nidkærhedens Hjerter fra Det Skarlagenrøde Kloster til Mesterapoteker Faranell.", " Hearts of Zeal from the Scarlet Monastery to Master Apothecary Faranell."},
    {"^Find ([%d%.,]+) Soran%'ruk Fragments and ([%d%.,]+) Large Soran%'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens%.$", "Find {1} Soran'ruk-fragmenter og {2} Stort Soran'ruk-fragment og tag dem retur til Doan Kanhan i Ødemarken.", " Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens."},
    {"^Return Vorrel Sengutz%'s wedding ring to Monika Sengutz in Tarren Mill%.\n\n([%d%.,]+)%/([%d%.,]+) Vorrel%'s Wedding Ring$", "Returner Vorrel Sengudsens vielsesring til Monika Sengudsen i Tarrenmølle.\n\n{1}/{2} Vorrels Vielsesring", "Return Vorrel Sengutz's wedding ring to Monika Sengutz in Tarren Mill.\n\n"},
    {"^Bring ([%d%.,]+) pile of Kraul Guano from the Kraul bats to Master Apothecary Faranell%.$", "Bring {1} dynge Kraul-guano fra Kraul-flagermusene til Mesterapoteker Faranell.", " pile of Kraul Guano from the Kraul bats to Master Apothecary Faranell."},
